     1	"""Megaplan product backend adapter for the M3 manifest runtime.
     2	
     3	The adapter subclasses ``arnold.execution.LocalJournalBackend`` and overrides
     4	``_execute_node_payload`` to dispatch explicit node IDs to relocated product
     5	handlers in ``arnold_pipelines.megaplan.handlers``.  Model and tool work is
     6	routed through ``arnold.agent`` registries and ``arnold.execution.registries``;
     7	no legacy worker paths from the neutral runtime are imported.
     8	"""
