    62	
    63	class MegaplanManifestBackend(LocalJournalBackend):
    64	    """Product backend that dispatches manifest nodes to Megaplan handlers.
    65	
    66	    The backend is intentionally thin: it bridges the neutral runtime's
    67	    ``_execute_node_payload`` hook to product handlers, translates their
    68	    ``StepResponse`` into ``NodeOutcome``, and emits control transitions for
    69	    branch choices.  Heavy policy remains in the handlers and in registries.
